"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm"> Report on Form 10-</a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm">Q</a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm"> for the </a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm">quarter ended March 31, 2026</a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm">, filed with the SEC on </a><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000031/zvra-20260331.htm">May 6, 2026</a></span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">, before investing in our common stock. There have been no material changes to the risk factors described in those reports. </span></div><div id="iea03b4e765da4f70803c4c4172d6bc86_127"></div><div style="margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:12pt;padding-left:94.5pt;text-indent:-94.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">ITEM 2.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;padding-left:57.86pt">UNREG